  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>The Free Worlds League's fractious politics have always made centralized BattleMech procurement difficult, pushing the FWLM toward heavy investment in conventional infantry to fill the gaps. Deploying Arrow IV artillery systems, these platoons field the most sophisticated indirect fire weapon available to conventional formations. Arrow IV rounds can be guided to their targets with remarkable precision, and the system's compatibility with homing munitions allows designated targets to be engaged with near-certainty.</p>"
